# Plan review window

After presenting a completed plan, give the user three minutes to review it before starting implementation.

- Do not begin implementation during that window unless the user explicitly says to proceed (for example, “execute,” “build it,” or “start now”).
- A plan-confirmation response does not waive the review window unless it explicitly authorizes implementation.
